        <h1>Facebook Ads for Roofers: Generate Better Roofing Leads</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">Facebook and Instagram advertising can introduce roofing services to property owners before they actively search for a contractor. Real project visuals, clear offers and a reliable follow-up process can help turn attention into qualified inspection opportunities.</p>
