        <strong>THE SHORT ANSWER</strong>
        <p>Facebook and Instagram advertising can introduce roofing services to property owners before they actively search for a contractor. Real project visuals, clear offers and a reliable follow-up process can help turn attention into qualified inspection opportunities.</p>
      </div>

